            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Throws? (क्षिपति, kṣipati.) Lets go? (मुञ्चति, muñcati.) Gets? (लभते, labhate.) Serves? (सेवते, sevate.) Enjoys? (रमते, ramate.) Steals? (चोरयति, corayati.) Eats up? (भक्षयति, bhakṣayati.) Strikes? (ताडयति, tāḍayati.) Keeps? (पालयति, pālayati.) Hurts? (पीडयति, pīḍayati.) Takes away? (हरति, harati.) Supports? (भरति, bharati.) Carries? (वहति, vahati.) Endures? (सहते, sahate.) Tries? (यतते, yatate.) Changes? (परिवर्तयति, parivartayati.) Reports? (निवेदयति, nivedayati.) Invites? (आमन्त्रयति, āmantrayati.) Cleans? (शोधयति, śodhayati.) Fills? (पूरयति, pūrayati.)"
            }
